{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n憑選秀節目《聲秀》彈出的甄敏芳Jenny近日在社交平台突發大派福利，上載多張極具男友視角感的美食照片引發熱烈討論。相中的她身穿性感吊帶上衣展露香肩，更對鏡頭頻頻放電甜笑。這批令網民暴動惹火照片背後隱藏着耐人尋味拍攝細節。\n</p>\n<h2>甄敏芳吊帶上陣展露香肩鎖骨</h2>\n<p>甄敏芳今日（10月23日）在社交網大方分享一輯在餐廳拍攝美照。從照片可見她當日穿上吊帶上衣，完美展現優越鎖骨線條與白滑香肩，並坐在餐桌前擺出多款可愛賣萌姿勢。她不僅對着鏡頭雙手托腮甜笑，其後更拿起叉子叉起一粒小番茄擋在鼻子前，盡顯調皮活潑一面。</p>\n<h2>社交平台配文親揭神秘人身分</h2>\n<p>面對外界對這輯充滿粉紅泡泡照片充滿好奇，甄敏芳親自透過社交平台配文為大眾解開謎團。她上載照片時同步寫下「老best視覺，唔知食第幾餐了🥗🥩🍪🍧」字句，直接交代這批極具男友視角照片其實出自相熟好友之手。直接言論不但打破了網上關於她有新戀情各種猜測，同時亦大方記錄了自己食慾大開真實一面。</p>\n<h2>曾主持《玄戰》憑精緻五官搶鏡</h2>\n<p>回顧甄敏芳演藝之路，她早前參與選秀節目《聲秀》時經已憑藉甜美樣貌與出眾氣質吸引不少觀眾目光。其後她更獲安排為另一電視節目《玄戰》擔任主持工作，在熒幕前展現出不一樣專業面貌。當時她憑藉精緻五官與亮眼外形成功在節目中搶去不少焦點，出眾外貌一直深受觀眾喜愛與關注。</p>\n<h2>超冧視角照曝光網民全被融化</h2>\n<p>該批引發廣泛關注照片發布後，隨即在各大網上平台引來大批網民圍觀及瘋狂讚好。不少粉絲紛紛湧入留言區表達激動心情，有網民直接留言大讚「笑容甜到漏」、「真係好靚女」，亦有人表示「完全被呢個視角電暈」。熱烈迴響令甄敏芳甜美形象再次受到廣泛喜愛，成為網民熱烈討論焦點。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274672352846971_8461974226adb24e465c95.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274672352846971_8461974226adb24e465c95.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274672933546628_1428214336adb24ea1ca43.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274672933546628_1428214336adb24ea1ca43.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274673424289539_9688109016adb24ee77df0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274673424289539_9688109016adb24ee77df0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274673782737438_20129039016adb24f2318ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274673782737438_20129039016adb24f2318ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274674181397020_20055656726adb24f610349.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274674181397020_20055656726adb24f610349.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274674494534225_13854752766adb24f94af88.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274674494534225_13854752766adb24f94af88.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_4797135656a9fb9a673127.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 聲秀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_4797135656a9fb9a673127.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:42:49.590740+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1050,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:39.629199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:35.314516+00:00","content_hash":"8ed2fa12a2ba46663b2abc133a81e3079263ce10bd8f003b46a2b0a93abcccb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}